<title>USA: Mercer Cty, N.J., won by Commerce Capital.</title>
<headline>Mercer Cty, N.J., won by Commerce Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce Capital said it won $1.999 million of Mercer County, N.J., county college bonds, Series 1997, with a lowest rate of 4.45, highest price of 100.0619.</p>
</text>
